==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{term|machinerie||machinery|lang=fr}}, from {{term|machine|lang=fr||machine}}; see [[machine]].

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|mə-shē'nə-rē}}
* {{audio|En-us-machinery.ogg|Audio (US)}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~|machinery}}

# The [[machine]]s constituting a production apparatus, in a plant etc.,  collectively.
# The working [[part]]s of a [[machine]] as a group.
# The [[collective]] parts of something which allow it to [[function]].
# {{context|figuratively|lang=en}} The literary devices used in a work, notably for dramatic effect

====Related terms====
* [[machinist]]

